# White Widow, Free Agent: "When White Widow enters, choose one - Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures; or return
# target artifact or enchantment card from your graveyard to your hand." There is no such card in Bot1's graveyard, so only the first
# mode can be chosen, and it is. Bot1 targets one of its own Ornithopters and Bot2's Ornithopter: each gets one counter, together;
# Bot1's other Ornithopter and White Widow herself, not chosen, get none; a third target is refused ("up to two").

